{"about_the_game":"Taking place in a single mansion in Candlewood, northeast USA, in the early 20th Century, <strong>House of Caravan is a sinister adventure filled with dark secrets and vexing puzzles</strong>.<br><br>Stepping into the role of a young boy captured by strangers on his way back from school, you'll be tasked with exploring the house, uncovering clues as to your kidnapping, while attempting to find a way out.<br><br>But in this apparently deserted mansion, something doesn't feel quite right.<br><br>With a gorgeously rendered 3D environment, full voice acting, and dozens of secrets to uncover, House of Caravan is a room escape game with a sinister twist..<br><br>Will you escape?<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Uncover a dark and twisted narrative to uncover, inspired by Edgar Allen Poe and classic horror films<br></li><li>Explore a gorgeously rendered house filled with riddles and conundrums \u2013 solve the puzzles to find your way out<br></li><li>A fusion of narrative exploration and point-and-click adventure \u2013 with full 3D and first-person perspective<br></li><li>60-90 minutes of game time on first play through</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Childs Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/353550/4d84d34aa68d319072425df74eca0e78610170c5.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzles, Inc.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/353550/8a457f3c8904294c85abffbc9b9407c8bbb12c29.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/353550/87bd91dde18f7bc6a900255d6bb2bce9d26ad65e.jpg"},{"name":"Hellreader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/353550/15dcbcaa54dca309b17151611f6600f97416a94c.jpg"},{"name":"The Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/353550/88451d4effe91c2f547b41973d955b75911a8a50.jpg"}],"